      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792086500951,
      "created": 1791228275195,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Market & Audience Research\n   ↳ Deliverable: Research Brief\n      (Market signals, competitor tactics)\n\n2. Strategy & Campaign Planning\n   ↳ Deliverable: Campaign Plan\n      (Multi-week themes & channel calendar)\n\n3. Authentic Arabic Content\n   ↳ Deliverable: Content Package\n      (Dialect-native copy + Brand Visual)\n\n4. Performance Interpretation\n   ↳ Deliverable: Performance Diagnosis\n      (Guaranteed intake of performance CSVs)\n\n5. External Social Execution\n   ↳ Deliverable: Approval Card\n      (15-min Batch Review UI → FB, IG, X)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Market & Audience Research\n   ↳ Deliverable: Research Brief\n      (Market signals, competitor tactics)\n\n2. Strategy & Campaign Planning\n   ↳ Deliverable: Campaign Plan\n      (Multi-week themes & channel calendar)\n\n3. Authentic Arabic Content\n   ↳ Deliverable: Content Package\n      (Dialect-native copy + Brand Visual)\n\n4. Performance Interpretation\n   ↳ Deliverable: Performance Diagnosis\n      (Guaranteed intake of performance CSVs)\n\n5. External Social Execution\n   ↳ Deliverable: Approval Card\n      (15-min Batch Review UI → FB, IG, X)",
