      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792086500951,
      "created": 1791228389504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Semantic Memory (PostgreSQL + Qdrant):\n   9 Canonical Entity Types:\n   Company Profile · Offering · Audience\n   Brand Rule · Positioning · Strategic Goal\n   Channel · Competitor · Company Fact\n\n• Procedural Memory (PostgreSQL):\n   Execution & style calibrations:\n   Egyptian conversational vs Gulf lifestyle\n   Approved styles & human review feedback\n\n• Two-Stage GraphRAG Retrieval:\n   Vector seed (Qdrant) +\n   1–2 hop relational graph expansion (PG)\n\n• Anti-Amnesia Governance:\n   Individual candidate review (no bulk)\n   Treatment vs control (≥50% fewer turns)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Semantic Memory (PostgreSQL + Qdrant):\n   9 Canonical Entity Types:\n   Company Profile · Offering · Audience\n   Brand Rule · Positioning · Strategic Goal\n   Channel · Competitor · Company Fact\n\n• Procedural Memory (PostgreSQL):\n   Execution & style calibrations:\n   Egyptian conversational vs Gulf lifestyle\n   Approved styles & human review feedback\n\n• Two-Stage GraphRAG Retrieval:\n   Vector seed (Qdrant) +\n   1–2 hop relational graph expansion (PG)\n\n• Anti-Amnesia Governance:\n   Individual candidate review (no bulk)\n   Treatment vs control (≥50% fewer turns)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
