      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. DUAL-MEMORY STORAGE PLANE",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "921600f0be914593b4a5d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2318.2,
      "y": -2060,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2Qa",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 855572416,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2020788895,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792086500954,
      "created": 1792085466651,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SEMANTIC MEMORY (PostgreSQL + Qdrant):\n  • 9 Canonical Entities: Company Profile,\n    Offering, Audience, Brand Rule, Positioning,\n    Strategic Goal, Channel, Competitor, Fact\n  • Relational Edges: TARGETS, COMPETES_WITH,\n    HAS_TONE, SOLVES_PAIN_POINT, RELATED_TO\n  • Qdrant Vectors: Semantic search with strict\n    workspace_id tenant isolation payload filtering\n\nPROCEDURAL MEMORY (PostgreSQL):\n  • Persistent execution & dialect guidelines\n  • Register calibration: Egyptian vs Gulf\n  • Eliminates recurring stylistic mistakes",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SEMANTIC MEMORY (PostgreSQL + Qdrant):\n  • 9 Canonical Entities: Company Profile,\n    Offering, Audience, Brand Rule, Positioning,\n    Strategic Goal, Channel, Competitor, Fact\n  • Relational Edges: TARGETS, COMPETES_WITH,\n    HAS_TONE, SOLVES_PAIN_POINT, RELATED_TO\n  • Qdrant Vectors: Semantic search with strict\n    workspace_id tenant isolation payload filtering\n\nPROCEDURAL MEMORY (PostgreSQL):\n  • Persistent execution & dialect guidelines\n  • Register calibration: Egyptian vs Gulf\n  • Eliminates recurring stylistic mistakes",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
