      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. TWO-STAGE GRAPHRAG RETRIEVAL",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. TWO-STAGE GRAPHRAG RETRIEVAL",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d9dcb60283424f9dbc25b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3193.2,
      "y": -2060,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2Qd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 491330743,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 426209457,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792086500954,
      "created": 1792085466651,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STAGE 1: Vector Seed Retrieval (Qdrant)\n  • Agent query embedded via LiteLLM\n  • Top-K semantic concept nodes retrieved\n  • Multi-tenant payload filtering applied\n\nSTAGE 2: Relational Graph Expansion (Postgres)\n  • Expands 1–2 hops along typed edges\n  • Pulls interconnected brand rules, target\n    audiences, and competitor context\n  • Injects procedural rules into prompt\n\nOUTCOME: Grounded execution with ≥50%\nfewer clarification turns vs raw docs",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STAGE 1: Vector Seed Retrieval (Qdrant)\n  • Agent query embedded via LiteLLM\n  • Top-K semantic concept nodes retrieved\n  • Multi-tenant payload filtering applied\n\nSTAGE 2: Relational Graph Expansion (Postgres)\n  • Expands 1–2 hops along typed edges\n  • Pulls interconnected brand rules, target\n    audiences, and competitor context\n  • Injects procedural rules into prompt\n\nOUTCOME: Grounded execution with ≥50%\nfewer clarification turns vs raw docs",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bf5b3ec92e964c1796c8d",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 4150,
      "y": -2250,
      "width": 2730,
      "height": 780,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1cdcaa",
      "backgroundColor": "#0c0c0d",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
